: "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_06", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_16", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_23", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_30", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_31", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_27", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_32", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_29", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_11", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_13", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_12", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_28", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_21", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_17", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_24", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_01", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_02", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_03", "role": "confounder_control"}], "narrative": "Every candidate wedge among these nodes closes only thousands of time units after its supporting contacts were established (e.g. 236\u2192792 by ~47.8k but 106\u2192792 not before 49.4k; 959\u2192175 ~45.9k and 80\u2192175 ~48.9k but 959\u219280 only after 53.4k; 332\u21921583 ~51k and 1583\u219280 only after 52.4k). No closing interaction is demonstrably within 800 units of its support, so the apparent triangles are artefacts of aggregate volume and hub popularity (nodes 28/1583), not a genuine temporal closure wave."}, "raw_final_response": "**Analysis summary**\n\nStatic triangles do exist among the listed nodes (13 incident triangles, step_04), but the temporal ordering shows the \"closing\" edges lag their supports by thousands of time units, far beyond the 800-unit criterion:\n\n- **80\u2013332\u20131583**: 80\u2192332 in [43373,46373]; 332\u21921583 in [50874,51573]; 1583\u219280 in [52374,53873]. Minimum possible closure lag \u2265 801, realistic lag ~1\u20132k; the first support\u2192second support gap alone is \u22654500.\n- **106\u2013236\u2013792**: 106\u2192236 in [43373,46373]; 236\u2192792 in [46374,47873]; closing 106\u2192792 only in [49374,50873] \u21d2 lag \u2265 1501.\n- **80\u2013175\u2013959**: 959\u2192175 in [45375,46375]; 80\u2192175 in [48378,49378]; closing 959\u219280 only in [53383,54383] \u21d2 lag \u2265 4000.\n\nConfounder controls: the window is busy (2853 events, 1623 active nodes) and includes strong hubs (28, 1583), so the triangles are explainable by hub popularity/aggregate volume rather than prompt triadic closure; the listed nodes themselves have only 2\u20135 events each with repeat ratio 0.014, i.e. no bursty closing activity.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"t_1852ce27\",\n  \"decision\": \"absent\",\n  \"mechanism\": \"closure_wave\",\n  \"entities\": [6, 10, 17, 37, 57, 72, 80, 87, 106, 111, 114, 116, 175, 236, 332, 792, 959, 1583],\n  \"window\": [43373, 55373],\n  \"confidence\": 0.79,\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_04\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_05\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_06\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_16\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_23\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_30\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_31\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_27\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_32\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_29\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_11\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_13\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_12\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_28\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_21\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_17\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_24\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_01\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_02\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_03\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"}\n  ],\n  \"narrative\": \"Every candidate wedge among these nodes closes only thousands of time units after its supporting contacts were established (e.g. 236\u2192792 by ~47.8k but 106\u2192792 not before 49.4k; 959\u2192175 ~45.9k and 80\u2192175 ~48.9k but 959\u219280 only after 53.4k; 332\u21921583 ~51k and 1583\u219280 only after 52.4k). No closing interaction is demonstrably within 800 units of its support, so the apparent triangles are artefacts of aggregate volume and hub popularity (nodes 28/1583), not a genuine temporal closure wave.\"\n}\n```", "total_input_tokens": 68519, "total_output_tokens": 9143, "total_tokens": 77662, "total_latency_ms": 119733, "llm_calls": 11, "schema_repairs": 0, "status": "success", "error": ""}